# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copyrighted data denylist.
#
# This project ships no data, artwork or code from Brasfoot. The files below
# belong to the original game and must never enter this repository. They are
# read from the player's own installation at runtime and stay on their machine.
#
# A single accidental commit of these means rewriting published history, so
# they are blocked here and in CI.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.ban
*.ces
*.cfg
*.bcf
*.s22
*.sbck
teams/
selecoes/
trofeus/
sons/
datasets/*/art/
